1
00:01:04,340 --> 00:01:07,660
=Bionic Trace=

2
00:01:07,740 --> 00:01:10,620
=Episode 18=

3
00:01:16,480 --> 00:01:17,040
Captain Deng.

4
00:01:17,190 --> 00:01:17,800
We've checked the area.

5
00:01:17,910 --> 00:01:19,400
No sign of the android Ada.

6
00:01:20,080 --> 00:01:21,190
Get the forensic team here
to collect samples.

7
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:22,720
Everyone else, keep searching.

8
00:01:23,590 --> 00:01:24,800
They can't have gotten far.

9
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:25,550
Yes, sir.

10
00:01:34,760 --> 00:01:35,680
Young lady.

11
00:01:35,800 --> 00:01:36,870
We're police officers.

12
00:01:36,870 --> 00:01:38,120
Don't be afraid.

13
00:01:38,590 --> 00:01:39,830
Can you tell me

14
00:01:40,040 --> 00:01:41,400
what happened here just now?

15
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:41,800
I...

16
00:01:42,190 --> 00:01:42,950
I don't know.

17
00:01:43,230 --> 00:01:45,000
Mingxuan brought me here.

18
00:01:45,510 --> 00:01:47,160
After that, I don't remember anything.

19
00:01:48,760 --> 00:01:49,590
Let me go!

20
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:50,630
Let me go!

21
00:01:55,590 --> 00:01:57,310
Have you seen a female android?

22
00:01:57,830 --> 00:01:58,590
Officer.

23
00:01:58,870 --> 00:01:59,910
She's right here with me.

24
00:02:02,190 --> 00:02:03,310
She's in my head, Officer.

25
00:02:03,590 --> 00:02:04,190
Officer!

26
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,190
Officer, she's in my head!

27
00:02:08,550 --> 00:02:09,630
Would you like to come in and see?

28
00:02:09,630 --> 00:02:11,000
Take them both to the station.

29
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:11,800
Keep them separated

30
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:12,880
and question them thoroughly.

31
00:02:13,670 --> 00:02:15,000
Notify all units.

32
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:17,600
Use the hospital as the center

33
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:19,720
and search every possible hiding place.

34
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:20,440
Officer!

35
00:02:20,440 --> 00:02:21,080
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

36
00:02:21,470 --> 00:02:22,720
She's really inside my head, Officer!

37
00:02:23,630 --> 00:02:23,960
Officer!

38
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:25,470
She's really inside my head, Officer!

39
00:02:26,600 --> 00:02:27,320
Officer!

40
00:02:43,830 --> 00:02:44,630
Song Yang.

41
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:46,320
They didn't follow us, did they?

42
00:02:46,390 --> 00:02:47,390
They're still searching.

43
00:02:47,670 --> 00:02:49,390
But it'll take them a while
to find this place.

44
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:50,550
I really don't know

45
00:02:50,550 --> 00:02:51,800
how Deng Ling managed to find you.

46
00:02:52,910 --> 00:02:54,080
Luckily,

47
00:02:54,270 --> 00:02:55,960
I planted a backdoor

48
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:56,800
in their communication channel.

49
00:02:57,390 --> 00:02:58,390
That's good.

50
00:02:58,630 --> 00:03:00,080
Keep me updated if anything happens.

51
00:03:00,360 --> 00:03:01,000
Okay.

52
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:04,240
Mr. Liu.

53
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:06,600
The police won't be coming
after us for now.

54
00:03:06,910 --> 00:03:08,030
Please keep your promise.

55
00:03:18,980 --> 00:03:20,380
(Yong'an Hospital)

56
00:03:20,600 --> 00:03:21,320
Hello?

57
00:03:21,880 --> 00:03:22,520
Dad.

58
00:03:22,720 --> 00:03:23,910
Are you at work?

59
00:03:24,110 --> 00:03:24,550
Yes.

60
00:03:24,550 --> 00:03:25,750
Have you been eating regularly?

61
00:03:25,910 --> 00:03:27,360
When are you coming back?

62
00:03:27,550 --> 00:03:28,390
Siqi.

63
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:31,190
I'll be back in a couple of days.

64
00:03:31,470 --> 00:03:32,390
Make sure you eat well.

65
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:33,830
Mr. Liu.

66
00:03:33,830 --> 00:03:35,800
Siqi's condition is getting worse.

67
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:37,630
She needs surgery within a week.

68
00:03:37,630 --> 00:03:38,360
As for the surgical fees...

69
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:39,000
Oh.

70
00:03:39,720 --> 00:03:41,080
By tomorrow at the latest.

71
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:41,830
No.

72
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:44,770
I can pay you today.

73
00:03:44,770 --> 00:03:45,600
Please do it as soon as possible.

74
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:01,520
Come on, guys.

75
00:04:01,520 --> 00:04:01,880
Let's have a drink.

76
00:04:01,880 --> 00:04:02,720
Boss Lie.

77
00:04:03,390 --> 00:04:04,800
Sorry to keep everyone waiting.

78
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:06,110
What took you so long in the bathroom?

79
00:04:07,190 --> 00:04:08,390
Sorry, Boss Lie.

80
00:04:09,030 --> 00:04:09,960
Uncle Hai.

81
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:11,190
Please don't call me Boss Lie.

82
00:04:11,390 --> 00:04:12,390
You're my senior.

83
00:04:12,720 --> 00:04:13,910
You're making me sound old.

84
00:04:13,910 --> 00:04:15,240
Don't shorten my life like that.

85
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:17,040
I may be a little older,

86
00:04:17,350 --> 00:04:18,920
but when it comes to this business,

87
00:04:19,200 --> 00:04:20,720
you're all more experienced than me.

88
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:22,350
Everything went

89
00:04:22,440 --> 00:04:23,270
so smoothly this time

90
00:04:23,390 --> 00:04:24,390
thanks to all of you.

91
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:25,040
Come on.

92
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:26,110
A toast to everyone.

93
00:04:36,230 --> 00:04:36,920
Boss Lie.

94
00:04:37,390 --> 00:04:39,230
Let's talk about splitting the money.

95
00:04:43,110 --> 00:04:43,950
Uncle Hai.

96
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:45,760
You're new here,

97
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:47,230
so you might not know the rules.

98
00:04:48,070 --> 00:04:49,230
In our line of work,

99
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:50,880
you have to earn your place.

100
00:04:51,070 --> 00:04:52,670
And that means paying your dues.

101
00:04:53,200 --> 00:04:55,160
This job was your initiation.

102
00:04:55,270 --> 00:04:57,000
You can get a share next time.

103
00:04:57,350 --> 00:04:58,110
Paying my dues?

104
00:04:58,320 --> 00:04:59,510
Plenty of people

105
00:04:59,510 --> 00:05:00,270
want to work with Boss Lie.

106
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:01,790
Don't waste your chance, Uncle Hai.

107
00:05:03,070 --> 00:05:04,950
Don't scare the old man.

108
00:05:08,390 --> 00:05:09,320
This time,

109
00:05:09,550 --> 00:05:10,720
the things we stole

110
00:05:12,640 --> 00:05:13,880
will sell for at least five million.

111
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:15,550
I'm not asking for much.

112
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:17,920
Just ten percent. Is that okay?

113
00:05:18,070 --> 00:05:19,390
You're pretty greedy, old man.

114
00:05:19,390 --> 00:05:20,760
You want ten percent?

115
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:28,040
Uncle Hai.

116
00:05:28,390 --> 00:05:29,440
Look.

117
00:05:29,880 --> 00:05:32,040
It says Cedar on it.

118
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:34,160
It's probably something confidential.

119
00:05:34,480 --> 00:05:35,440
You could sell it

120
00:05:35,670 --> 00:05:36,950
for quite a bit of money.

121
00:05:38,440 --> 00:05:39,550
That's a good find, Uncle Hai.

122
00:05:39,760 --> 00:05:41,270
I'd love to have one myself.

123
00:05:41,790 --> 00:05:43,720
It's just an ordinary USB drive.

124
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:46,640
When we were leaving,

125
00:05:46,640 --> 00:05:47,760
you grabbed a whole handful

126
00:05:47,790 --> 00:05:48,670
for everyone

127
00:05:48,670 --> 00:05:49,640
to keep as souvenirs.

128
00:05:49,640 --> 00:05:51,200
I know they're empty.

129
00:05:51,200 --> 00:05:52,790
Then keep them as souvenirs.

130
00:05:53,790 --> 00:05:54,760
Exactly.

131
00:05:54,760 --> 00:05:56,270
USB drives are useful.

132
00:05:56,390 --> 00:05:57,390
You can take them home

133
00:05:57,390 --> 00:05:59,920
for your daughter to use for school.

134
00:06:03,510 --> 00:06:04,790
Anyway, today,

135
00:06:05,230 --> 00:06:06,550
no matter what you say,

136
00:06:07,480 --> 00:06:08,270
I insist on getting

137
00:06:08,390 --> 00:06:09,510
my share of the money.

138
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:11,200
I've earned it.

139
00:06:11,510 --> 00:06:13,230
Who says you're entitled to anything?

140
00:06:14,830 --> 00:06:16,110
Don't be ungrateful.

141
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:19,270
Boss Lie.

142
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:20,390
My daughter's in the hospital.

143
00:06:20,550 --> 00:06:21,480
She needs surgery.

144
00:06:22,200 --> 00:06:23,350
This money could save her life.

145
00:06:23,640 --> 00:06:24,600
I'm begging you.

146
00:06:24,830 --> 00:06:25,790
Let go.

147
00:06:26,070 --> 00:06:26,760
Please, I'm begging you.

148
00:06:26,880 --> 00:06:27,760
If you won't give me 500,000,

149
00:06:27,880 --> 00:06:28,760
I'll take 400,000,

150
00:06:28,760 --> 00:06:29,760
or even 300,000.

151
00:06:29,760 --> 00:06:30,830
- Please, I'm begging you.
- Don't push your luck, old man.

152
00:06:35,350 --> 00:06:37,550
I hate it when people grab my clothes.

153
00:07:06,300 --> 00:07:11,300
(Yong'an Hospital: 48 missed calls)

154
00:07:23,270 --> 00:07:24,920
We couldn't reach you by phone.

155
00:07:25,390 --> 00:07:27,480
The doctors and nurses in our department

156
00:07:27,660 --> 00:07:29,500
pooled their money to cover the surgery.

157
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:31,440
Fortunately, the surgery went well.

158
00:07:33,160 --> 00:07:34,090
Didn't you say

159
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:36,000
she would regain

160
00:07:36,350 --> 00:07:37,320
her sight

161
00:07:37,320 --> 00:07:38,110
after the surgery?

162
00:07:38,270 --> 00:07:39,350
If you'd managed

163
00:07:39,350 --> 00:07:40,790
to pay for the surgery last night,

164
00:07:41,480 --> 00:07:43,000
there might still have been a chance.

165
00:07:43,270 --> 00:07:44,350
But this morning,

166
00:07:44,670 --> 00:07:46,000
Siqi's condition suddenly worsened.

167
00:07:46,350 --> 00:07:48,350
We were worried that
without immediate surgery,

168
00:07:48,510 --> 00:07:50,200
the cancer cells would spread.

169
00:07:50,600 --> 00:07:51,440
Mr. Liu.

170
00:07:52,040 --> 00:07:53,760
Siqi's ongoing treatment

171
00:07:53,760 --> 00:07:55,230
will cost a considerable amount.

172
00:07:56,230 --> 00:07:58,270
We can't cover the expenses anymore.

173
00:08:07,140 --> 00:08:07,780
Dad.

174
00:08:28,110 --> 00:08:28,830
Dad.

175
00:08:30,230 --> 00:08:31,080
Are you there?

176
00:08:32,910 --> 00:08:34,470
Is anyone there?

177
00:08:51,550 --> 00:08:52,590
(I couldn't bear)

178
00:08:52,880 --> 00:08:54,440
(to face my daughter again.)

179
00:08:55,350 --> 00:08:56,590
(But at the time, I felt)

180
00:08:56,760 --> 00:08:58,200
(it wasn't my fault.)

181
00:08:58,710 --> 00:08:59,520
(At least,)

182
00:08:59,880 --> 00:09:01,230
(it wasn't entirely my fault.)

183
00:09:03,790 --> 00:09:04,670
Who's there?

184
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:05,470
At this hour?

185
00:09:05,550 --> 00:09:06,280
It's me.

186
00:09:06,550 --> 00:09:07,200
Oh.

187
00:09:07,400 --> 00:09:08,150
Uncle Hai.

188
00:09:08,150 --> 00:09:08,710
Well,

189
00:09:09,030 --> 00:09:10,230
I thought Boss Lie

190
00:09:10,230 --> 00:09:11,590
had killed you.

191
00:09:11,910 --> 00:09:12,710
I'm still alive.

192
00:09:13,400 --> 00:09:15,320
Let me in. I need to talk to you.

193
00:09:15,710 --> 00:09:17,350
I have nowhere else to go.

194
00:09:19,280 --> 00:09:20,110
Come in.

195
00:09:47,400 --> 00:09:48,790
After I killed them,

196
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:50,200
I went to the black market

197
00:09:50,400 --> 00:09:51,840
and sold most of the parts

198
00:09:52,110 --> 00:09:53,200
to get the money

199
00:09:53,520 --> 00:09:54,880
for Siqi's medical bills.

200
00:09:57,080 --> 00:09:57,790
After that,

201
00:09:59,000 --> 00:10:00,780
I hid near the hospital,

202
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:03,590
posing as a janitor.

203
00:10:05,910 --> 00:10:07,440
I watched the hospital all day,

204
00:10:08,350 --> 00:10:09,400
hoping

205
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:11,230
to catch a glimpse of my daughter.

206
00:10:12,710 --> 00:10:14,080
But I never imagined

207
00:10:14,400 --> 00:10:16,470
things would turn out this way.

208
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:18,440
You must also know

209
00:10:19,710 --> 00:10:21,590
that even if you'd gotten
the money that night

210
00:10:21,710 --> 00:10:23,080
and paid for the surgery,

211
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:24,840
Siqi still might

212
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:26,350
have lost her sight.

213
00:10:26,590 --> 00:10:27,400
Yes.

214
00:10:28,590 --> 00:10:29,290
So

215
00:10:30,760 --> 00:10:32,110
I don't think all the blame

216
00:10:33,110 --> 00:10:33,790
should

217
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:34,670
fall

218
00:10:34,760 --> 00:10:35,760
on Siqi.

219
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:37,790
I

220
00:10:38,470 --> 00:10:40,350
used to repair cars.

221
00:10:40,760 --> 00:10:42,520
Siqi's mother passed away early.

222
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:45,470
I supported us on my own

223
00:10:45,470 --> 00:10:47,350
and worked hard to raise her.

224
00:10:47,880 --> 00:10:49,150
But three years ago,

225
00:10:50,520 --> 00:10:51,630
everything I knew how to do,

226
00:10:52,410 --> 00:10:53,680
every job I could take,

227
00:10:55,030 --> 00:10:56,620
was replaced by androids.

228
00:10:57,590 --> 00:10:59,320
You work more efficiently.

229
00:10:59,840 --> 00:11:00,790
You don't get sick.

230
00:11:00,790 --> 00:11:01,760
You don't take time off.

231
00:11:02,030 --> 00:11:03,320
You don't make mistakes.

232
00:11:04,960 --> 00:11:06,200
And you don't age.

233
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:09,440
I'm fifty years old.

234
00:11:10,350 --> 00:11:11,360
In this world,

235
00:11:12,200 --> 00:11:13,550
what can I possibly do now?

236
00:11:15,990 --> 00:11:17,960
I've already lost everything.

237
00:11:19,680 --> 00:11:20,510
I just want

238
00:11:21,670 --> 00:11:22,820
to hold on to a little

239
00:11:24,760 --> 00:11:26,300
human dignity.

240
00:11:32,200 --> 00:11:34,710
Liu Guanghai wanted revenge
for his daughter.

241
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:36,640
But it was also because

242
00:11:36,640 --> 00:11:38,510
Lie and the others had humiliated him.

243
00:11:39,150 --> 00:11:40,670
He wanted revenge for himself, too.

244
00:11:40,920 --> 00:11:42,840
I've gained an even deeper understanding

245
00:11:43,230 --> 00:11:44,760
of how complex humans are.

246
00:11:45,320 --> 00:11:46,440
To put it simply,

247
00:11:48,350 --> 00:11:50,030
I acted on impulse.

248
00:11:52,110 --> 00:11:53,200
In the end,

249
00:11:54,280 --> 00:11:55,180
I was the one

250
00:11:56,030 --> 00:11:58,520
who harmed that man

251
00:11:59,200 --> 00:12:00,350
named Zhang Mingxuan.

252
00:12:00,690 --> 00:12:02,150
But after a few days,

253
00:12:02,400 --> 00:12:03,790
I calmed down.

254
00:12:05,400 --> 00:12:06,400
If he had

255
00:12:06,400 --> 00:12:07,670
downloaded more

256
00:12:07,670 --> 00:12:08,640
of my memories,

257
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:10,840
perhaps he wouldn't be so

258
00:12:10,840 --> 00:12:12,400
violent and unstable now.

259
00:12:14,350 --> 00:12:15,880
So you didn't kill the fourth person?

260
00:12:15,880 --> 00:12:16,710
No.

261
00:12:19,400 --> 00:12:21,200
Given her position,

262
00:12:22,440 --> 00:12:23,790
if I'd killed her,

263
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:26,640
I wouldn't have stayed hidden until now.

264
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:28,000
Then who is she?

265
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:41,320
Target identified.

266
00:12:41,470 --> 00:12:42,550
Split up and search.

267
00:12:42,790 --> 00:12:43,590
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

268
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:50,910
Have you seen this person?

269
00:12:51,350 --> 00:12:52,110
No.

270
00:12:52,520 --> 00:12:53,590
Take another look.

271
00:12:54,110 --> 00:12:54,960
I really haven't.

272
00:12:55,230 --> 00:12:55,520
Captain Deng.

273
00:12:55,520 --> 00:12:55,910
Captain Deng.

274
00:12:56,110 --> 00:12:57,200
You need to come back to the station.

275
00:12:57,790 --> 00:12:59,000
I'm searching for the android right now.

276
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:00,000
I can't come back yet.

277
00:13:00,880 --> 00:13:02,400
Come back with the others first,
Captain Deng.

278
00:13:03,910 --> 00:13:04,840
We've made a major discovery.

279
00:13:04,840 --> 00:13:05,790
It's related to Song Yang.

280
00:13:21,670 --> 00:13:22,590
How did you manage

281
00:13:22,590 --> 00:13:23,550
to calm him down?

282
00:13:23,960 --> 00:13:25,840
We administered a high dose of sedatives

283
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:27,350
along with neurological treatment.

284
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:28,910
Right now,

285
00:13:28,910 --> 00:13:30,550
he's temporarily lucid.

286
00:13:31,110 --> 00:13:32,440
The suspect's name is Zhang Mingxuan.

287
00:13:32,440 --> 00:13:33,760
He's a writer.

288
00:13:34,280 --> 00:13:35,670
To find inspiration,

289
00:13:35,840 --> 00:13:37,790
he illegally used
a brain-computer interface

290
00:13:38,150 --> 00:13:39,440
to access other people's memories.

291
00:13:39,440 --> 00:13:41,000
That's what caused his mental confusion.

292
00:13:43,300 --> 00:13:45,780
(Suspect Investigation Report)

293
00:13:45,790 --> 00:13:47,470
What does he have to do with Song Yang?

294
00:13:48,150 --> 00:13:49,640
He has no direct connection
to Song Yang.

295
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:51,030
But he's involved in another

296
00:13:51,030 --> 00:13:52,110
serial murder case.

297
00:13:52,760 --> 00:13:54,230
The killer is

298
00:13:54,230 --> 00:13:56,350
Liu Guanghai, a former auto mechanic.

299
00:13:56,520 --> 00:13:58,880
DNA testing of blood found in the alley

300
00:13:59,150 --> 00:14:00,440
confirmed it belonged to Liu Guanghai.

301
00:14:02,400 --> 00:14:03,840
A serial murder case?

302
00:14:04,670 --> 00:14:05,590
Why haven't I heard about it?

303
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:07,200
Team Two was originally
investigating it.

304
00:14:07,400 --> 00:14:08,790
But the victims were thieves

305
00:14:08,790 --> 00:14:10,790
who had stolen secrets from Cedar Group.

306
00:14:11,320 --> 00:14:13,080
So the case was later

307
00:14:13,080 --> 00:14:14,000
forcibly closed as a gang fight.

308
00:14:14,590 --> 00:14:15,910
They didn't even intend

309
00:14:15,910 --> 00:14:16,880
to pursue the killer.

310
00:14:17,470 --> 00:14:19,470
We only just received the DNA results.

311
00:14:19,710 --> 00:14:21,400
That's how we got permission
to access the file.

312
00:14:22,110 --> 00:14:23,080
How dare they?

313
00:14:24,030 --> 00:14:24,880
Three people died,

314
00:14:24,880 --> 00:14:26,000
and they just covered it up?

315
00:14:33,790 --> 00:14:34,590
Go on.

316
00:14:36,320 --> 00:14:37,550
What else did Zhang Mingxuan say?

317
00:14:37,960 --> 00:14:39,400
Zhang Mingxuan had purchased

318
00:14:39,400 --> 00:14:40,640
many memories on the black market.

319
00:14:41,400 --> 00:14:42,640
Most of them involved

320
00:14:42,640 --> 00:14:44,320
relatively minor offenses.

321
00:14:44,520 --> 00:14:46,280
Among them were Liu Guanghai's memories.

322
00:14:47,350 --> 00:14:49,400
After accessing Liu Guanghai's memories,

323
00:14:49,550 --> 00:14:50,520
Zhang Mingxuan began showing

324
00:14:50,520 --> 00:14:51,590
increasingly severe

325
00:14:51,590 --> 00:14:53,110
symptoms of schizophrenia.

326
00:14:53,470 --> 00:14:56,230
He claimed Liu Guanghai's
memories influenced him.

327
00:14:56,710 --> 00:14:58,030
He acted on Liu Guanghai's

328
00:14:58,030 --> 00:14:59,350
unfulfilled desire

329
00:14:59,590 --> 00:15:01,640
to kill the mastermind behind the theft.

330
00:15:04,030 --> 00:15:05,130
And he succeeded.

331
00:15:05,960 --> 00:15:07,350
Who was the victim?

332
00:15:17,910 --> 00:15:25,190
♪I'm the one who's broken♪

333
00:15:26,020 --> 00:15:30,890
♪Calm, ordinary, and reckless♪

334
00:15:30,930 --> 00:15:33,800
♪That's me, too♪

335
00:15:35,340 --> 00:15:38,860
♪Carefully sketching
and shaping every detail♪

336
00:15:39,690 --> 00:15:43,160
♪Laughter and tears make life feel real♪

337
00:15:43,780 --> 00:15:47,570
♪Don't fear that it's not worth it.
Just be brave♪

338
00:15:47,890 --> 00:15:50,420
♪And learn from your mistakes♪

339
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:55,020
♪If the human heart
is impossible to fathom♪

340
00:15:55,020 --> 00:15:57,150
♪Could selling my soul and body♪

341
00:15:57,150 --> 00:16:00,320
♪Bring me something more?♪

342
00:16:01,020 --> 00:16:07,750
♪Stroke by stroke,
I draw the perfect outline♪

343
00:16:08,580 --> 00:16:11,980
♪Sadness is blue♪

344
00:16:12,960 --> 00:16:16,200
♪How would you paint me?♪

345
00:16:17,200 --> 00:16:20,930
♪Layering, crossing, blending endlessly♪

346
00:16:21,030 --> 00:16:23,190
♪Painting without restraint♪

347
00:16:23,380 --> 00:16:25,970
♪Covering the person I used to be♪

348
00:16:25,970 --> 00:16:30,160
♪If I could start over♪

349
00:16:30,330 --> 00:16:34,230
♪I'd show more feeling
in every look and gesture♪

350
00:16:34,340 --> 00:16:36,980
♪Give me back my smile♪

351
00:16:37,580 --> 00:16:40,060
♪Find joy even in hardship♪

352
00:16:40,560 --> 00:16:45,800
♪Don't let the next version of me
be left with nothing♪
